/-!
# Same-lineage component and kinetic responsibility at the endpoint

The endpoint macro ledger and the kinetic endpoint residual are generated by
the same bounded whole-restart source, but their canonical presentations use
different indices: the physical velocity endpoint refines the kinetic weak
subsequence.  This module performs that source-owned reindexing before any
Fourier or pair quotient.

Every aligned row contains the endpoint-written component occurrence and the
complete kinetic endpoint residual read from the identical actual restart
current.  Literal shift therefore gives one product effective process and one
componentwise forced trace.  On its kinetic coordinate the square norm still
converges to the exact endpoint defect while every fixed finite Fourier
projection converges to zero.  No reindexing, endpoint, cutoff, branch,
nonzero witness or defect value is supplied by a caller.
-/

